  "oracle: ComfyUI 2aa4d535a76e4b6acf6a94f263bc482430c396dd, ComfyUI-GGUF 373048b8403a7820620065210a691263d4da0a61, UnetLoaderGGUF with dequant_dtype float32, each LoRA through comfy.lora.load_lora and add_patches at its strength, merge float32: each weight patched per call dequantized and patched in float32, then cast to the pass dtype once, as ComfyUI core merges a LoRA on the CPU",
  "lora keys: a file stock ComfyUI's key map places in full goes through it unchanged (key_map stock), else ComfyUI's key map for the model, with the diffusers names of diffusers 0.43.0's MiniMax-H3 LoRA converter added: q, k, v as offset keys on thirds of qkv_proj's rows, ff.net.0.proj with comfy.utils.swap_scale_shift as its key function (key_map extended)",
